      {
        "spanId": "dsn_64660d17772d0007f83dc9ad",
        "ref": "dsn_64660d17772d0007f83dc9ad",
        "quotedText": "4 Alaio Security Assistance. Administrator agrees that Alaio will assist in ensuring compliance with any obligations of Administrator in respect of security of personal data and personal data breaches, including (if applicable) Administrator's obligations pursuant to Articles 32 to 34 (inclusive) of the GDPR, by:",
