      {
        "spanId": "dsn_371318afd6229bfb45da39ac",
        "ref": "dsn_371318afd6229bfb45da39ac",
        "quotedText": "3 Delivery of Notification. Alaio will deliver its notification of any Data Incident to the Notification Email Address or, at Bitrix24 discretion, by other direct communication (for example, by phone call or an in-person meeting). Administrator is solely responsible for ensuring that the Notification Email Address is current and valid.",
